<div class="player-stat-val">133</div>
<div class="player-stat-label">Yards Needed Monday</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p>Smith-Njigba's latest game was a 9-catch, 150-yard, one-touchdown night in Seattle's 20-3 win over Kansas City, his sixth 100-yard game of the season. He leads the NFL in receiving yards and touchdowns, and the gap is enormous: the next-closest receiver in yards, Chris Olave, has 636.</p>
